# Drum synthesis test: kick on 1/3, snare on 2/4, hats on 8ths.
@bpm 130
@ticks 6

@inst 0 drum kick tune=-12 decay=200 tone=80 snap=60 volume=255
@inst 1 drum snare tune=0 decay=140 tone=150 snap=120 volume=220
@inst 2 drum hat tune=36 decay=40 tone=110 snap=200 volume=160
@inst 3 drum clap tune=0 decay=140 tone=160 snap=180 volume=200

@order
0 0 0 0

@pattern 0 16
